Hephaestus credits the following upstream sources:

- K-Scale Labs (https://github.com/kscalelabs), MIT-licensed humanoid robotics
  reference designs, RL training infra (ksim), URDF/MJCF tooling. Various repos
  archived locally for reference; Hephaestus does not redistribute K-Scale code.
- Henrique Ferrolho (https://github.com/ferrolho/VL53L5CX-BNO08X-viewer), MIT-
  licensed reference implementation of the BNO085 + VL53L5CX sensor combo and
